    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ac7b28c17ef80.90975986\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">In Patch 12.1.5, Delve curios are getting an update, with new ones being added and a 5th rank being added for all Curios!<h2 id=\"new-ranks\" class=\"heading-size-2 heading-bar\"><span data-markup-content-target=\"1\">New Ranks</span></h2>With the release of Labyrinths in Patch 12.1.5, all curios are getting a 5th rank for more power and effects! Players can acquire these from the new Labyrinth of Kindo'jan activity, releasing in Patch 12.1.5.<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1304961.jpg\" id=\"1304961\"><img width=\"400\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1304961.jpg?maxWidth=400\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"Rank 5 Curio\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 0.830986 / 1;\"></a>&nbsp;</div><h2 id=\"new-curios\" class=\"heading-size-2 heading-bar\"><span data-markup-content-target=\"1\">New Curios</span></h2>In addition to the 5th rank being added, two new curios are being added: one Combat Curio and one Utility Curio. The curios below are shown at Rank 5/<wbr>5. <br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><span data-markup-tooltip-container=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\" class=\"wowhead-tooltip-inline exclude-units wowhead-tooltip-inline-icon\"><div class=\"wowhead-tooltip wowhead-tooltip-width-restriction wowhead-tooltip-width-320\" data-game=\"wow\" data-tree=\"live\" data-env=\"ptr2\" data-type=\"spell\" data-visible=\"yes\" style=\"width: 320px; visibility: visible;\"><div class=\"whtt-tooltip-icon\" style=\"visibility: visible;\"><div class=\"iconmedium\" data-env=\"ptr2\" data-tree=\"live\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"spell\"><ins class=\"lazy-load-background\" style=\"background-image: url(&quot;https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_relics_6orunestone_ogremissive.jpg&quot;);\"></ins><del></del></div></div><table><tbody><tr><td><table style=\"width: 100%;\"><tbody><tr><td><a class=\"whtt-name\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/ptr-2/spell=1314978/dusty-loa-totem\"><b class=\"whtt-name\"></b></a><b class=\"whtt-name\"><a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1314978/dusty-loa-totem\" data-disable-wowhead-tooltip=\"true\">Dusty Loa Totem</a></b></td></tr></tbody></table><table style=\"width: 100%;\"><tbody><tr><td><div class=\"q\"><a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/ptr-2/spell=1314974/dusty-loa-totem\" target=\"_blank\">Upon entering combat, and every 60 sec, gain either <span style=\"color:#FFFFFF\">Might of the Loa</span> or <span style=\"color:#FFFFFF\">Grace of the Loa</span> for 30 sec.<br><br><span class=\"tooltip-inside-icon\" style=\"background-image: url(//wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/small/inv_10_misc_winterpeltfurbolg_totem.jpg)\"></span><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF\">Might of the Loa</span><br>Dust-covered claw sigils awaken beneath your touch, increasing your maximum health by 25% and Primary Stat by 15%.<br><br><span class=\"tooltip-inside-icon\" style=\"background-image: url(//wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/small/inv_gianteagle2sunwalkermount_white.jpg)\"></span><span style=\"color:#FFFFFF\">Grace of the Loa</span><br>Dust-covered feather sigils awaken beneath your touch, increasing your Speed by 25% and Haste by 15%.</a></div></td></tr></tbody></table></td><th style=\"background-position: right top;\"></th></tr><tr><th style=\"background-position: left bottom;\"></th><th style=\"background-position: right bottom;\"></th></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"wowhead-tooltip-powered\"></div></div></span><span data-markup-tooltip-container=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\" class=\"wowhead-tooltip-inline exclude-units wowhead-tooltip-inline-icon\"><div class=\"wowhead-tooltip wowhead-tooltip-width-restriction wowhead-tooltip-width-320\" data-game=\"wow\" data-tree=\"live\" data-env=\"ptr2\" data-type=\"spell\" data-visible=\"yes\" style=\"width: 320px; visibility: visible;\"><div class=\"whtt-tooltip-icon\" style=\"visibility: visible;\"><div class=\"iconmedium\" data-env=\"ptr2\" data-tree=\"live\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"spell\"><ins class=\"lazy-load-background\" style=\"background-image: url(&quot;https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_jewelcrafting_jadeserpent.jpg&quot;);\"></ins><del></del></div></div><table><tbody><tr><td><table style=\"width: 100%;\"><tbody><tr><td><a class=\"whtt-name\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/ptr-2/spell=1314570/viperwind-idol\"><b class=\"whtt-name\"></b></a><b class=\"whtt-name\"><a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1314570/viperwind-idol\" data-disable-wowhead-tooltip=\"true\">Viperwind Idol</a></b></td></tr></tbody></table><table style=\"width: 100%;\"><tbody><tr><td><div class=\"q\"><a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/ptr-2/spell=1314569/viperwind-idol\" target=\"_blank\">Your spells and abilities have a chance to turn you into a furious vortex of venom, inflicting significant Nature damage to all nearby enemies every 0.5 sec.<br><br>Venom coils wildly around you and hardens, reducing damage taken by 50%.<br><br></a><a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/ptr-2/spell=1314550/viperwind-idol\" target=\"_blank\">The venomous trail you leave behind later explodes, inflicting additional significant Nature damage.</a><br><br><a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/ptr-2/spell=1314572/viperwind-idol\" target=\"_blank\">Pull enemies further than 8 yds from you every 0.5 sec. The same enemy can only be pulled once every 4 sec.</a></div></td></tr></tbody></table></td><th style=\"background-position: right top;\"></th></tr><tr><th style=\"background-position: left bottom;\"></th><th style=\"background-position: right bottom;\"></th></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"wowhead-tooltip-powered\"></div></div></span></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>In Patch 12.1.5, Delve curios are getting an update, with new ones being added and a 5th rank being added for all Curios!<br /><br /><h2 class=\"heading-size-2\">New Ranks</h2><br /><br />With the release of Labyrinths in Patch 12.1.5, all curios are getting a 5th rank for more power and effects! Players can acquire these from the new Labyrinth of Kindo'jan activity, releasing in Patch 12.1.5.<br /><br /><h2 class=\"heading-size-2\">New Curios</h2><br /><br />In addition to the 5th rank being added, two new curios are being added: one Combat Curio and one Utility Curio. The curios below are shown at Rank 5/5. <br /><br /></noscript>            \n        ",
