    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ac7b2ec43c243.88639145\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">WoW: Forever's beta level cap is now raised to 30, and everyone wants to try it - so we're helping with that opportunity! We're giving away even more Skyborne Epic Packs in our latest sweepstakes. <br><br>This time, there are 45 Skyborne Epic Packs up for grabs, which lets even more people try out WoW: Forever during the last stretch of beta and beyond! <br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1305001.jpg\" id=\"1305001\"><img width=\"800\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1305001.jpg?maxWidth=800\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"forever epic pack\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 1.77778 / 1;\"></a></div><div class=\"injected-ad-container\"><div class=\"htlad-desktop-dynamic-btf\"></div></div><br><br><b>To enter for a chance to win, simply comment below on this article with what class you'll get to level 30 first in WoW: Forever!</b> The official release date for Forever is November 4th, but from now until October 21st, players can test out the Beta and see what's in store on official release.<br><br> <ins>45 total winners</ins> will be selected and contacted by Monday, October 12th. Good luck!<br><br><div class=\"markup-grid exclude-units\" style=\"--markup-gridColumnWidth: min(375px, 100%);\"><div class=\"\"><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><br><br><br><br><div class=\"last\" style=\"max-width:400px; background:#181818; border:1px solid rgba(196,30,58,0.25); border-radius:4px; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"first\" style=\"background:rgba(47,47,200,0.05); color:#c41e3a; padding:9px 14px; font-size:11px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:1px; font-weight:700; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(196,30,58,0.25);\">The Prizes</div><div class=\"last\" style=\"padding:12px 14px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5; color:#e6e6f0;\"><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><span class=\"large-text\"><span class=\"c11\">Grand Prize (x45):</span></span></div><div class=\"pad exclude-units\"></div>Everyone is a Grand Prize winner in this sweepstakes, and with 45 Skyborne Epic Packs to go out, each winner will receive access to the WoW: Forever beta until its conclusion on October 21, in-game goodies like mounts, transmog, and toys, early name reservation for Forever's launch, 30 days of WoW game time, housing decor, and of course, unlock the new Skyborne race!<br></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"last\"><div class=\"pad exclude-units first\"></div><div class=\"pad exclude-units\"></div><div class=\"pad exclude-units\"></div><div class=\"pad exclude-units\"></div><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Winners will be selected by random drawing from all eligible entries received.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">One (1) entry per person, regardless of entry method. Multiple comments or entries will not increase your odds of winning.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">The Sweepstakes begins at the publishing of this post on October 7th, 2026 and ends at 11:59:59 PM PT on October 11th, 2026. Entries received outside the Sweepstakes Period will not be eligible.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">To enter through this article, your entry must be submitted in the comment section below and contain a valid response. Comments on other Wowhead posts or social media will not count as entries.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Comments removed for spam or violations of Wowhead's site rules will not be eligible for entry and may be subject to normal site moderation.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Potential winners will be contacted by October 12th, 2026 and will have three (3) days to respond and satisfy the applicable eligibility requirements.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Winners may need to confirm their age, location, and eligibility before receiving a prize. Anyone who is ineligible or can't legally receive a prize will be disqualified, and a new winner will be randomly drawn.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever-beta-sweepstakes-terms-and-conditions\" data-contiguous=\"true\">Legal Disclaimers, Eligibility Addendum and Official Rules</a></div></li></ul></div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>WoW: Forever's beta level cap is now raised to 30, and everyone wants to try it - so we're helping with that opportunity! We're giving away even more Skyborne Epic Packs in our latest sweepstakes. <br /><br />This time, there are 45 Skyborne Epic Packs up for grabs, which lets even more people try out WoW: Forever during the last stretch of beta and beyond! <br /><br /><b>To enter for a chance to win, simply comment below on this article with what class you'll get to level 30 first in WoW: Forever!</b> The official release date for Forever is November 4th, but from now until October 21st, players can test out the Beta and see what's in store on official release.<br /><br /> <u>45 total winners</u> will be selected and contacted by Monday, October 12th. Good luck!<br /><br /> The Prizes<br /><br /> Grand Prize (x45):<br /><br />Everyone is a Grand Prize winner in this sweepstakes, and with 45 Skyborne Epic Packs to go out, each winner will receive access to the WoW: Forever beta until its conclusion on October 21, in-game goodies like mounts, transmog, and toys, early name reservation for Forever's launch, 30 days of WoW game time, housing decor, and of course, unlock the new Skyborne race!<br /><br /><ul><li>Winners will be selected by random drawing from all eligible entries received.</li><li>One (1) entry per person, regardless of entry method. Multiple comments or entries will not increase your odds of winning.</li><li>The Sweepstakes begins at the publishing of this post on October 7th, 2026 and ends at 11:59:59 PM PT on October 11th, 2026. Entries received outside the Sweepstakes Period will not be eligible.</li><li>To enter through this article, your entry must be submitted in the comment section below and contain a valid response. Comments on other Wowhead posts or social media will not count as entries.</li><li>Comments removed for spam or violations of Wowhead's site rules will not be eligible for entry and may be subject to normal site moderation.</li><li>Potential winners will be contacted by October 12th, 2026 and will have three (3) days to respond and satisfy the applicable eligibility requirements.</li><li>Winners may need to confirm their age, location, and eligibility before receiving a prize. Anyone who is ineligible or can't legally receive a prize will be disqualified, and a new winner will be randomly drawn.</li><li><a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever-beta-sweepstakes-terms-and-conditions\">Legal Disclaimers, Eligibility Addendum and Official Rules</a></li></ul><br /><br /></noscript>            \n        ",
